    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/9bc1cddae845812ff5214a6fca9a7bfe.poster.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/9bc1cddae845812ff5214a6fca9a7bfe.webm?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/9bc1cddae845812ff5214a6fca9a7bfe.mp4?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/1662df1bf0cdf9b2954f396c9f7fc634.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a mysterious journey</strong> through a fractured realm where eras clash and realities intertwine. <i><strong>The Infernalist</strong></i> tests the boundaries between realities combining\u00a0<strong>fantasy</strong> and <strong>science fiction</strong> elements in a unique and captivating way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Infernalist</strong></i> is a compelling <strong>point-and-click</strong> adventure where you dive into a rich narrative filled with exploration, puzzles, and turn-based combat, all set against the backdrop of a visually stunning environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/7b268edd5ae65917883086f707ba4fc4.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/6b4a6d5e2b04bfd3fba56f0e0fba66ad.poster.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/6b4a6d5e2b04bfd3fba56f0e0fba66ad.webm?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/6b4a6d5e2b04bfd3fba56f0e0fba66ad.mp4?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/46ce5f2ebb930ffef64f2734cd5084c6.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Lyra Quasar</strong>, an enigmatic wanderer with fragments of forgotten memories. Awakened in a world where ancient myths intertwine with advanced technology, you must uncover your true self while navigating a realm on the brink of collapse. Your journey leads you to the enigmatic figure known as the Infernalist, whose existence is tied to the echoes of your past. Will you find the truth about yourself before chaos consumes everything?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover memory fragments</strong>, pieces of Lyra\u2019s past, granting you powerful abilities essential for your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect this already tumbling world from malevolent entities</strong>, including hooded skeletons desecrating the ruins of once-thriving druidic civilizations and ancient godlike beings whose incomprehensible power threatens to unravel reality itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage with a host of characters</strong>, each offering unique abilities and insights, as you collaborate to progress through the game. Use your restored knowledge and the expertise of your allies to unlock new items and gear that aid your journey. Together, you\u2019ll craft powerful artifacts, solve intricate puzzles, and overcome obstacles using a blend of strategy and creativity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/7b268edd5ae65917883086f707ba4fc4.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/d1f65cb09b6d83b30d93d40fe8aec876.poster.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/d1f65cb09b6d83b30d93d40fe8aec876.webm?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/d1f65cb09b6d83b30d93d40fe8aec876.mp4?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/a1803d080500f048cc93893998515a9c.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself</strong> in the shattered realm of <strong>The Infernalist</strong>, where the fabric of reality is torn asunder.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witness the fusion of ancient forests and futuristic technology</strong>, as you traverse the realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel intricate puzzles hidden within the corrupted landscape</strong>: from deciphering ancient runes etched into crumbling stone to manipulating unstable magical phenomena that twist reality itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover fragments of your past scattered across the world</strong>, with interactive objects and environmental details serving as a clue to unlocking your forgotten memories and the mysteries of your existence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/7b268edd5ae65917883086f707ba4fc4.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/54bafed2a37a1b2cdfa7fa7d0dc37a33.poster.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/54bafed2a37a1b2cdfa7fa7d0dc37a33.webm?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/54bafed2a37a1b2cdfa7fa7d0dc37a33.mp4?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/257fb41e14ea096cad6514b614f8554c.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather a group of companions</strong>, each with their own strengths and weaknesses, to aid you in your journey. Learn new abilities and master them as you progress through the game, unlocking new possibilities for combat and exploration.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble a team of unique allies</strong>, each with their own backstory, motivations, and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master powerful abilities</strong> that blend elemental forces, technological marvels, and ancient magic, allowing you to overcome challenges as you progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on an immersive exploration of a mysterious world</strong>, uncovering hidden secrets and piecing together the fragmented memories of your past while navigating its intricate lore and dangers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/7b268edd5ae65917883086f707ba4fc4.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/910f72e57c094ebcdfc0f6eb1994196c.poster.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/910f72e57c094ebcdfc0f6eb1994196c.webm?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/910f72e57c094ebcdfc0f6eb1994196c.mp4?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/1c17c8adeb7e0b3d453940d6bf21b305.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like <strong>episodic</strong> narrative-driven games with mystery and puzzles? <strong>Wishlist now</strong> to follow development and be notified on launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will launch in <strong>Early Access</strong> with <strong>Chapter 1</strong>, offering approximately one hour of polished, story-driven gameplay. New chapters will be added over time as <strong>free</strong> updates, expanding the story, introducing new environments and mechanics, and building toward the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned Release Schedule</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q1 2026:</strong>\u00a0Early Access Launch: Chapter 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q2 2026:</strong> Chapter 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q4 2026:</strong> Chapter 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q2 2027:</strong> Chapter 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q4 2027:</strong> Chapter 5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q2 2028:</strong> Chapter 6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q4 2028:</strong> Final Chapter &amp; 1.0 Complete Story Release</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This roadmap reflects the current plan, but please note: as a solo developer, life and development challenges may affect the schedule. I\u2019ll communicate openly about any changes along the way.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/9bc1cddae845812ff5214a6fca9a7bfe.poster.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/9bc1cddae845812ff5214a6fca9a7bfe.webm?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/9bc1cddae845812ff5214a6fca9a7bfe.mp4?t=1753391031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/1662df1bf0cdf9b2954f396c9f7fc634.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a mysterious journey</strong> through a fractured realm where eras clash and realities intertwine. <i><strong>The Infernalist</strong></i> tests the boundaries between realities combining\u00a0<strong>fantasy</strong> and <strong>science fiction</strong> elements in a unique and captivating way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Infernalist</strong></i> is a compelling <strong>point-and-click</strong> adventure where you dive into a rich narrative filled with exploration, puzzles, and turn-based combat, all set against the backdrop of a visually stunning environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824970/extras/7b268edd5ae65917883086f707ba4fc4.avif?t=1753391031\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://share